id: zw_startup
label: Z-Wave Startup Component
category: Z-Wave
description: >
  This component provides the Z-Wave system startup implementation for Silicon Labs devices.
  It initializes the hardware required by the Z-Wave protocol, determines the reset and wake-up
  reason, and records GPIO flags from EM4 wake-up events. The component also provides the BURTC
  counter information used for deep-sleep duration calculations, and supplies the FreeRTOS idle,
  stack-overflow, and static-task-memory hooks.
  It depends on the platform abstraction layer for retention registers, watchdog, NVM, and
  initialization services.
package: zwave
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: zw_sbom_license
source:
- path: "platform/SiliconLabs/components/zw_startup/zw_startup.c"
include:
- path: "platform/SiliconLabs/components/zw_startup/"
  file_list:
  - path: "zw_startup.h"
provides:
- name: zw_startup
root_path: zwave
